YZCWRu0-l3RpS7QO36KEHHWWuKQq6idr9ZBZa8ZYofvfo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD04AWwylLLmvMeTVxqmcf6qQVsprR5Rjrc44FX1Gx8uw&oe=6A5F7767"}, {"file_name": "peek.png", "id": "1009464856621649", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_1009464859954982_7090744758627338677_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cbjI8xkicQUQ7kNvwGmT92f&_nc_oc=Adp3rUuaLFEAUig-wfbJXol6QHE_5L5QSHyP8aMI7pu337WAGoPgOySK71PVLiOxwa0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAwgXzg3BMGA1BUB_sVNJZxxY3tyJmQDv_kZ12pIl3o5g&oe=6A5F5BDC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "banner.png", "id": "636604377435150", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003244_636604380768483_6976895474501699949_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rIhpXieSAWAQ7kNvwH37iJf&_nc_oc=AdpxNmsMuzSX9S99PaEZAUtV7lGNznCVCezk9VGY3dtmWRN-5L3r8VUkUgHPQuS5_mQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAreDbCIE9Vh3yR68mwWt5ZH3qDkuRcYpKEY9c5EDdTPg&oe=6A5F56B6"}, "display_name": "Puppet VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Puppet VR is like a virtual puppet theater. Pick a bunny, make a recording, repeat. Improvise a funny scene, or have conversations with yourself!\n\n**Features**\n- 4 space bunnies, controlled by YOU\n- Record your voice, movement, or both\n- Play back your recordings - all 4 at the same time\n- Play in Quest Standalone - no wires needed\n\n**Your creativity's the limit!**\n- Create funny scenes, with yourself from the past\n- Go a capella, and make the bunnies sing\n- Host a bunny dance party\n- ... And more!\n\nPuppet VR is currently in development", "short_description": "A virtual puppet theater where every actor is YOU!\n\nControl up to 4 bunnies at the same time, and use them to make a movie, sing a song or host a dance party - your creativity is the limit!"}]}, "developer_name": "Daniel Tauritis", "developer_privacy_policy_url